    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "the crisis lines wont change my reality though. it's not like a phone call is gonna pay off my loans or fix the fact that i've wasted the last ten years chasing a life that's just a dead end. it feels like i'm just stuck on this treadmill and the faster i run, the more tired i get, but the scenery never changes. it's just constant, crushing pressure. there's no \"breakthrough\" coming, it's just more of the same until i die of exhaustion anyway.",
