      "content": "it just feels so irrational to keep fighting for a life that's this broken. like, everything is just weighted so heavily against me that staying in this loop seems more painful than just... not being here. if there's no real fix for the debt or the failure, then what's the actual point of all this struggle? it feels like the only way to actually get peace is to just stop everything completely.",
